## A plant for name_hunt's `preposition_split`: `segment_at` beside
## `segment_behind` is one noun given two prepositions. `_at` is on only two
## stems of the shape `U32 -> F64` here. quiet_suffix_convention_in_file.roc
## has a third, which must not exempt this pair: a pair's verdict comes from
## its own file.
Sighting := [].{
	segment_at : U32 -> F64

	segment_behind : U32 -> F64

	height_at : U32 -> F64
}
